{"root":{"data":{"id":"876428b12b05","created":1570761059,"text":"MySQL中DataType(8.0为例)"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bxmccdzccww0","created":1570761113957,"text":"NUMERIC TYPE","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bxmdqsx28rk0","created":1570765064679,"text":"M表示最大的支持长度\nZEROFILL表示自动补齐，比如INT(5)，输入数字12，数据库会自动补齐成00012"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bxmdf0ii1lc0","created":1570764140843,"text":"BIT"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bxmchwyktds0","created":1570761547091,"text":"bit-value type，取值范围1-64，若不指定默认为1"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bxmdvc2yrco0","created":1570765419852,"text":" BIT(M)类型在赋值时，如果没有完全用完位数会自动填充补齐\ne.g. assigning a value of b'101' to a BIT(6) column is, in effect, the same as assigning b'000101'"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bxmdf6u1pcw0","created":1570764154602,"text":"TINYINT"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bxmcjckj29c0","created":1570761659434,"text":"取值范围 -128 ～ 127（signed），0 ～255（unsigned）"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bxmdfb4t27k0","created":1570764163960,"text":"BOOL/BOOLEAN"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bxmcjx0msi80","created":1570761703943,"text":"类型和TINYINT(1)相等，0表示false，1表示True"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bxmdfh68rsw0","created":1570764177107,"text":"SMALLINT"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bxmclhxigv40","created":1570761827831,"text":"取值范围-32768 ~ 32767(signed), 0 ~ 65535(unsigned)"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bxmdfkot04g0","created":1570764184760,"text":"MEDIUMINT"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bxmcpdvklcg0","created":1570762132463,"text":"取值范围 -8388608 ～ 8388607，0 ~ 16777215"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bxmdicl69pc0","created":1570764402219,"text":"INT/INTEGER"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bxmcq3tmh340","created":1570762188942,"text":"取值范围 -2147483648 ～ 2147483647， 0 to 4294967295"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bxmdihm7kig0","created":1570764413165,"text":"BIGINT"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bxmcqxlmedc0","created":1570762253762,"text":"取值范围 -9223372036854775808 ～ 9223372036854775807（signed）， 0 ～ 18446744073709551615（unsigned）"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bxmdimg8vyg0","created":1570764423689,"text":"MySQL数学运算都使用 signed 的 BIGINT 和 DOUBLE，所以unsigned的BIGINT 不能超过signed的BIGINT最大值（922...， 63bits），不然会自动转为DOUBLE处理，发生计算错误"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bxmdixejgww0","created":1570764447530,"text":"BIGINT还在MYSQL的运算中有这样的应用，min() max() 整数之间的+ - *"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bxmdj9f2zww0","created":1570764473684,"text":"DECIMAL(M [, D])\nsyn: DEC，NUMERIC，FIXED","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bxmcs4b0c800","created":1570762346722,"text":"M表示digits的位数（精度），D是小数点后允许的位数，M最大是65（默认为10），D最大是30（默认为0）"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bxmdjnm0l7c0","created":1570764504578,"text":"非整数间的 + - * 都使用DECIMAL"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bxmdjrhiiwg0","created":1570764513013,"text":"同义词类型中FIXED适配其他的DBS "},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bxmdjzpmrog0","created":1570764530918,"text":"FLOAT(M, D)"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bxmd1zt8hpc0","created":1570763120581,"text":"单精度浮点数，Permissible values are -3.402823466E+38 to -1.175494351E-38, 0, and 1.175494351E-38 to 3.402823466E+38（IEEE标准，取决于硬件和OS可能更小）"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bxmdk3ixsjs0","created":1570764539221,"text":"M是digits总位数，D表示小数点后的位数，省略时，默认按OS支持的最大，通常float对应的decimal place是7"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bxmdk5wzhhc0","created":1570764544424,"text":"FLOAT[M, D]是一种不标准的MySQL扩展，这种语法正在弃用并将在后续被彻底移除"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bxmdkbev81k0","created":1570764556389,"text":"FLOAT(P)"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bxmd4yj5t280","created":1570763352888,"text":"浮点数without M和D，p表示bits精度，MySQL中，p在0～24认为是单精度浮点数（FLOAT），p在25～53认为是双精度浮点数（DOUBLE）。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bxmdkf7ba340","created":1570764564639,"text":"这种语法是为了ODBC适配。\nODBC(Open Database Connectivity，开放数据库互连)是微软公司开放服务结构(WOSA，Windows Open Services Architecture)中有关数据库的一个组成部分"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bxmdkmw9ezk0","created":1570764581385,"text":"DOUBLE(M, D)\nDOUBLE PRECISION(M, D), REAL(M, D) ","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bxmd802ezns0","created":1570763591321,"text":"双精度浮点数，Permissible values are -1.7976931348623157E+308 to -2.2250738585072014E-308, 0, and 2.2250738585072014E-308 to 1.7976931348623157E+308（IEEE标准，实际更小）","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bxmdk3ixsjs0","created":1570764539221,"text":"M是digits总位数，D表示小数点后的位数，无时默认按OS支持的最大，通常decimal对应的decimal place是15"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bxmdk5wzhhc0","created":1570764544424,"text":"DOUBLE[M, D]是一种不标准的MySQL扩展，这种语法正在弃用并将在后续被彻底移除"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bxmdnrd27qo0","created":1570764826201,"text":"DOUBLE PRECISION 和 REAL 是DOUBLE的同义词，但如果设置了READL_AS_FLOAT则REAL表示FLOAT类型而非DOUBLE"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bxmdy2z464w0","created":1570765635120,"text":"本质上来说，DECIMAL/NUMERIC类型才是fixed-point type(exact value)\nFLOAT/DOUBLE 类型，不管如何提高精度，也是floating-point type(approximate value)，用来进行高精度计算会出问题；auto_increment特性在版本8从这两种类型上弃用"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bxmccec8rxc0","created":1570761114737,"text":"Date&Time Type","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bxmhcyc3y740","created":1570775263814,"text":"fsp: fractional seconds precision，毫秒的位数/精度，MySQL中TIME，DATETIME和TIMESTAMP类型支持毫秒，精度最高为6 digits\n省略时，默认精度为0，而标准SQL默认为6"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bxmhipowfxc0","created":1570775715182,"text":"DATE"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bxmhj2l3w0w0","created":1570775743251,"text":"DATE，YYYY-MM-DD。取值范围'1000-01-01' to '9999-12-31'。DATE列允许存 numbers/strings(e.g. 19950911, 1995-09-11)"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bxmhlip2bd40","created":1570775935047,"text":"DATETIME(fsp)"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bxmhlnyrkm80","created":1570775946517,"text":"形式：YYYY-MM-DD hh:mm:ss[.fraction]，取值范围'1000-01-01 00:00:00.000000' to '9999-12-31 23:59:59.999999'。允许numbers/strings"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bxmhox0dbtc0","created":1570776201298,"text":"TIMESTAMP(fsp)"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bxmifuuypn40","created":1570778312450,"text":"取值范围'1970-01-01 00:00:01.000000' UTC to '2038-01-19 03:14:07.999999' UTC\n不能为'1970-01-01 00:00:00.000000'是因为0要作为（'0000-00-00 00:00:00'）这一时间点的保留值"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bxmijby9v1c0","created":1570778584748,"text":"TIME","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bxmije2d41s0","created":1570778589349,"text":"'hh:mm:ss[.fraction]' format，取值范围'-838:59:59.000000' to '838:59:59.000000'，允许number/string"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bxmijvlb1uo0","created":1570778627499,"text":"YEAR(4)","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bxmikeoa1j40","created":1570778669038,"text":"4-digit format，YYYY format。Values display as 1901 to 2155, and 0000\n不同的digit标识year后，一般特指本世纪或上世纪"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"bxmcceem3ns0","created":1570761114881,"text":"String Type","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bxmilytx4v40","created":1570778791279,"text":"CHARACTER SET属性","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bxmimw4qn480","created":1570778863767,"text":"BINARY"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bxminc1tbgg0","created":1570778898418,"text":"CHARSET BINARY后，CHAR becomes BINARY, VARCHAR becomes VARBINARY, and TEXT becomes BLOB\nENUM类型和SET类型不会发生改变"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bxmioyks6hk0","created":1570779025819,"text":" ASCII attribute is shorthand for CHARACTER SET latin1"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bxmip6gsiqo0","created":1570779042992,"text":"UNICODE attribute is shorthand for CHARACTER SET ucs2"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bxmisaprfzc0","created":1570779287334,"text":"NATIONAL ","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bxmit1pfuu80","created":1570779346087,"text":" NCHAR or NATIONAL CHAR 表示列应该使用预设的CHARSET，就MySQL而言是UTF8"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bxmituonaxs0","created":1570779409166,"text":"e.g.\nNATIONAL CHARACTER(10)\nNCHAR(10)\nSELECT N'some text';\nSELECT n'some text';\nSELECT _utf8'some text';"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bxmiumugq740","created":1570779470468,"text":"CHAR(M)"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bxmiuuxeg140","created":1570779488060,"text":"定长string存储时会在右填充，直到LENGTH满足设定值，M 范围0~255，若省略，则为1"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bxmixffde3c0","created":1570779689410,"text":"CHAR(0) 可以用来占位实际中不使用的列，只会有两种值，NULL和‘’空字符串"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bxmiqeigffk0","created":1570779138871,"text":"VARCHAR(M)"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bxmiyjffgio0","created":1570779776485,"text":"不定长string中M表示其可占用的最长字符length，M范围0～65535bytes，具体可存多少视编码，\n比如utf8中一个character占用3个bytes，而utf8mb4占用4个。所以前者可存21844字节"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bxmj0qqptq00","created":1570779949133,"text":"BINARY(M)"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bxmj0zdndog0","created":1570779967934,"text":"BINARY type 和 CHAR type相似，只是以字节形式存储的。M表示字节数范围，M defaults to 1."},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bxmj0sd63qg0","created":1570779952668,"text":"VARBINARY(M)"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bxmj27zbdk80","created":1570780065023,"text":"TINYBLOB"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bxmj4b7d6g00","created":1570780228768,"text":"一种BLOB列，最大长度 255 (2^8 − 1) bytes. \nTINYBLOB 存储值时用 1byte 作为前缀 标识value的字节长度"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bxmj2z4q0ds0","created":1570780124123,"text":"TYNYTEXT"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bxmj6n9l25c0","created":1570780411752,"text":"一种TEXT列，最大 255 (2^8 − 1) 字符characters. \n TINYTEXT 存储值时用 1byte 作为前缀 标识value的字节长度"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bxmj32yzso00","created":1570780132483,"text":"BLOB"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bxmj5klrh6o0","created":1570780327594,"text":"一种BLOB列，最大长度 65,535 (216 − 1) bytes. \n存储值时用 2 bytes 作为前缀 标识value的字节长度"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bxmj34uue3s0","created":1570780136586,"text":"TEXT"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bxmj7fvqbiw0","created":1570780474041,"text":"一种TEXT列，最大 65535 (2^16 − 1) 字符characters. \n TINYTEXT 存储值时用 1byte 作为前缀 标识value的字节长度"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bxmj39ngp1k0","created":1570780147024,"text":"MEDIUMBLOB"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bxmj7z6ucrk0","created":1570780516072,"text":"16,777,215 (2^24 − 1) bytes max length\n3 bytes prefix"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bxmj3cctejc0","created":1570780152910,"text":"MEDIUMTEXT"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bxmj8f2hzs00","created":1570780550638,"text":"a maximum length of 16,777,215 (2^24 − 1) characters\n3-byte length prefix"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bxmj3g3qveg0","created":1570780161069,"text":"LONGBLOB"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bxmj8pwngao0","created":1570780574229,"text":" a maximum length of 4,294,967,295 or 4GB (2^32 − 1) bytes\n4-byte length prefix"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bxmj3kcicy00","created":1570780170306,"text":"LONGTEXT"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bxmj911ar4w0","created":1570780598454,"text":"a maximum length of 4,294,967,295 or 4GB (232 − 1) characters\n4-byte length prefix"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bxmj3mhzd8w0","created":1570780174990,"text":"ENUM(value1, value2)"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bxmja3c5bag0","created":1570780681828,"text":"An enumeration. 枚举。字符串对象只能是list中的某一个值或NULL，ENUM内部将值标识为数字，最多有65,535 distinct elements."},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bxmjdru078g0","created":1570780970243,"text":"The maximum supported length of an individual ENUM element is M <= 255 and (M x w) <= 1020, \nM是单个element的literal length，W是set内单个member的最大字节长度maximum-length character in the character set"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bxmj3nwdfs80","created":1570780178037,"text":"SET(value1, value2)"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bxmja6s1ao80","created":1570780689319,"text":"字符串集合，一个字符串对象拥有0或多个值。set内部将值表示为数字。最多能有64个不同值"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bxmjbtljyfs0","created":1570780817357,"text":"an individual SET element is M <= 255 and (M x w) <= 1020\nM是单个element的literal length，W是set内单个member的最大字节长度maximum-length character in the character set"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"bxmjgke79uw0","created":1570781189142,"text":"SPATIAL DATA TYPE"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bxneweqq11c0","created":1570869885073,"text":"专为OpenGIS Geometry Model 的datatype"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bxnexbrjha80","created":1570869956956,"text":"hold geometry values：GEOMETRY，POINT，LINESTRING，POLYGON"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bxneycsob4g0","created":1570870037565,"text":"hold collections of values: MULTIPOINT, MULTILINESTRING, MULTIPOLYGON, GEOMETRYCOLLECTION"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bxmjgq1lmc00","created":1570781201441,"text":"JSON DATA TYPE"},"children":[]}]},"template":"right","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}